--- !u!114 &1445653212
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1445653211}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 624e549c1d4a98e4faec03a65f67aa4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  animator: {fileID: 1445653214}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1445653215}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1128160910}
  actionPromptText: {fileID: 1196481021}
  efsunText: {fileID: 0}
  trigger: {fileID: 172543013}
  Bilge: 0
  Kaptan: 0
  Amara: 0
  Fiona: 1
  dialogues:
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cefbde2a401563e4fa34659722af4752, type: 3}
    subtitle: Sen de kimsin?
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 1
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e610082436d3d124c93be274f897fc1f, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Anlatabilece\u011Fim bir \u015Fey kalmad\u0131, benden geriye ne kald\u0131,
      bilmiyorum ama... Fiona ben. Bir zamanlar, g\xFC\xE7le donat\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
      Eski B\xFCy\xFCn\xFCn son ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131ndan biriydim."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 19
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f77d2c6200b56e14f9c3c37826be11bc, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131lar m\u0131? Lyra d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda
      ba\u015Fkalar\u0131 da m\u0131 vard\u0131?"
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 5
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e15e56ea8213fd3419eb0e801a16152b, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Lyra ve ben d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda kimse kalmam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131...
      Ta ki g\xFC\xE7lerim \xE7al\u0131nana kadar."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 11
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ad0e973fcd54cb428e90f1247cc3a60, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Onu buldu\u011Fumda, g\xF6zlerinden siyah kanlar s\xFCz\xFCl\xFCyordu.
      Sonra beni buraya y\xF6nlendirdi."
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 6
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74ca89bd31c1db344a72a8c256b24757, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Beni biliyor olmal\u0131... Umbra bu... Hepsi benim y\xFCz\xFCmden."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 6
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8f981bf5763dd94b980677926699934, type: 3}
    subtitle: Bu ne demek?
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 1
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d8ba14c1a0411849944c4e5eb80b212, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Velor... Eski B\xFCy\xFCn\xFCn pe\u015Findeydi. Beni, Lyra'ya ula\u015Fmak
      i\xE7in kulland\u0131. \xC7ok uzun bir zamand\u0131r burada i\u015Fkence g\xF6rd\xFCm,
      g\xFCc\xFCm al\u0131nd\u0131. Umbra lanetini yapmak i\xE7in g\xFC\xE7lerimi
      kulland\u0131. Ve sonunda ona da ula\u015Ft\u0131 demek."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 23
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad03e9b34dd3c264fae6f023e16b29c9, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Nas\u0131l hayatta kald\u0131n ve Lyra'ya nas\u0131l ula\u015Faca\u011F\u0131m?
      L\xFCtfen bana anlat, onsuz ya\u015Fayamam"
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 7
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95d5ff5fc641dd1499f681a24ff2c6b9, type: 3}
    subtitle: "G\xFC\xE7lerim onlara yard\u0131m etti\u011Fi i\xE7in, bir \xF6d\xFClm\xFC\u015F
      gibi bedenimi verdiler ama... G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn gibi, \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC
      ve g\xFC\xE7lerimi asla... Lyra'ya art\u0131k kavu\u015Famazs\u0131n. Ruh bedenden
      ayr\u0131l\u0131nca beden yok olmaya ba\u015Flar, Kael. Bizim i\xE7in yap\u0131lacak
      hi\xE7bir \u015Fey kalmad\u0131."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 24
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fc06d5414e0b544786f5a0e0d0f9b25, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Hay\u0131r, bu oyun hen\xFCz bitmedi. Lyra'n\u0131n bedeni Ay I\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131
      Ma\u011Faras\u0131'nda korunuyor."
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 7
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe0eadf65c5077b4999c4220a45c4bf4, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Ay \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 ma\u011Faras\u0131 ...  o zaman
      hala bir \u015Fans\u0131m\u0131z var... Soulshard'a git, Kael. Onu Burada tutuyorlar,
      koridordan ruh yank\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 hissedebiliyorum. Lyra'n\u0131n ruhunu
      bedeninden ay\u0131ran laneti ve g\xFC\xE7lerini, Soulshard ad\u0131n\u0131
      verdikleri o ta\u015Fta tutuyorlar."
    npcTalks: 1
    subtitleDuration: 23
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 203783b38d0ee964d98ff644bf65065a, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Nas\u0131l bulaca\u011F\u0131m Fiona?"
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 2
  - audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1fd555447bd98a6428f7a18154a62100, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Eski b\xFCy\xFCn\xFCn son ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 Lyra
      ile..."
    npcTalks: 0
    subtitleDuration: 3
